      <headword id="idp115484888">còir</headword>
      <description>Quotation: Còir gu robh Màiri aig a’ chèilidh. Notes: ‘So Mary was at the cèilidh.’</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp115469768">crìoch</headword>
      <description>Quotation: Chan eil crìoch cuin a bhios sin deiseil. Notes: Goodness knows when that will be finished.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp115478768">cromadh</headword>
      <description>Quotation: Tha i cromadh air an deoch. Notes: She is becoming addicted to drink.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp115450328">cuir</headword>
      <description>Quotation: Chuir e an dà shùil air. Notes: He stared in amazement.</description>
